Subject: [PATCH] ole32: OleConvertIStorageToOLESTREAMEx (patch 5110)

Presentation data from the caller as an OLE 1 StandardPresentationObject;
gap-CORE item 506. Gate with two mutants.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01XZFS4SPPzeH5d2c1MuzqCS
